              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28.17-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.3+DEU.16.4+DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6+DEU.16.7+DEU.16.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 16.3-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nino man bibedo nino me poyo pe wiwu ma wubigwoko me bedo nino madit bot Rwot; wubikwero wun ki likwayowu obed cik matwal: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubicamo mugati ma pe girubo rye tobi pi nino abiro; i kom nino mukwoŋo wukwany tobi ki i ot, wuony woko. Ka ŋatti mo bicamo mugati ma tobi tye iye, nia i nino mukwoŋo nio wa i nino me abiro, dano-nu waŋe birwenyo woko ki i kin jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kom nino mukwoŋo wubibedo iye ki gurre maleŋ; ki i nino me abirone bene wubibedo iye ki gurre maleŋ; pe gibitiyo tic mo i nino meno ducu; ento gin ma dano ducu camo, meno aye wuyubi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubikwero nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye, pien i kom nino meno kikome yam akwanyo iye bucawu ki i lobo Ejipt; mumiyo wubikwero nino meno, wun ki likwayowu ducu, obed cik matwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dwe mukwoŋo, i kom nino dwe apar wiye aŋwen otyeno, wubicamo mugati ma pe girubo iye tobi, nio wa i nino dwe pyeraryo wiye acel otyeno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe ginoŋ tobi mo i odiwu i kom nino abiro-ni; pien ka ŋatti mo bicamo gin ma girubo iye tobi, dano meno waŋe birwenyo woko ki i kin lwak pa jo Icrael, kadi bed en labedo nyo anywalli me lobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wubicamo gin mo ma girubo iye tobi; ka ma wubibedo iye ducu wubicamo mugati ma tobi pe iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
